    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Java-aware <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST" kindref="compound">AST</ref> traversal. This is a pre/post depth-first traversal that is aware of certain Java attributes and follows them even when <ref refid="classAstSimpleProcessing" kindref="compound">AstSimpleProcessing</ref> would not follow them. The functor should take two arguments: SgNode*, and <ref refid="classAstSimpleProcessing_1a473b61b6c878fa3102dc309801f158d9" kindref="member">AstSimpleProcessing::Order</ref> (the constant preorder or postorder depending on whether the call is before or after the children are traversed). Attributes are considered to be the first children of a node. </para>    </detaileddescription>
